---
layout: ""
pagination:
  data: categories
  size: 1
  alias: cat
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "/tax-column/{{ cat.slug }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  catName: "{{ cat.name }}"
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>{{ cat.name }} 세무 칼럼 | 율광 세무회계 - 서초구 재산 전문 세무사</title>
  <meta name="description" content="{{ cat.name }} 관련 세무 칼럼을 모았습니다. 율광 세무회계 박준우 세무사가 실무 사례로 정리한 {{ cat.name }} 정보입니다." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://yool-gwang.com/tax-column/{{ cat.slug }}/" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />

  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "CollectionPage",
    "name": "{{ cat.name }} 세무 칼럼",
    "description": "{{ cat.name }} 관련 세무 칼럼 모음",
    "url": "https://yool-gwang.com/tax-column/{{ cat.slug }}/",
    "isPartOf": {
      "@type": "WebSite",
      "name": "율광 세무회계",
      "url": "https://yool-gwang.com/"
    }
  }
  </script>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="column-header">
    <a href="/" class="column-logo">율광 세무회계</a>
    <nav class="column-nav">
      <a href="/">홈</a>
      <a href="/tax-column/">세무 칼럼</a>
      <a href="{{ cat.detailUrl }}">{{ cat.name }} 안내</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="column-main">
    <p class="column-category">세무 칼럼</p>
    <h1 class="column-title">{{ cat.name }}</h1>
    <p class="column-hub-desc">{{ cat.name }} 관련 칼럼을 모았습니다.</p>

    <ul class="column-hub-list">
      {%- for post in collections.column | reverse %}
        {%- if post.data.category == cat.slug %}
        <li class="column-hub-item">
          <a href="{{ post.url }}">
            <span class="column-hub-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
            {%- if post.data.subcategory %}
            <span class="column-hub-sub">{{ post.data.subcategory }}</span>
            {%- endif %}
          </a>
          <p class="column-hub-summary">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        </li>
        {%- endif %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>

    <div class="column-cta">
      <p>{{ cat.name }} 관련 상담이 필요하신가요?</p>
      <div class="column-cta-buttons">
        <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeD10N-yh3TcPQUV8oW6neJ4tMDyE8oBrq7dmqhmmKeT1N7Ww/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn">상담 예약 신청하기</a>
        <a href="tel:02-2088-5906" class="btn btn-outline-dark">02-2088-5906</a>
        <a href="http://pf.kakao.com/_blMan/chat" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-kakao">카카오톡 상담</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="column-footer">
    <p>율광 세무회계 · 서울 서초구 방배로27길 9, 2층 202호 · 02-2088-5906</p>
    <p>&copy; 2026 율광 세무회계</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
